• join condition
• load SQL
• next relation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="155" width="340" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
